Package: a3-core-app
Version: 0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Rafjagger
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, pipewire, pipewire-jack, wireplumber, jack-example-tools
Breaks: a3-core (<< ${a3:Version}), a3-engine
Replaces: a3-core (<< ${a3:Version}), a3-engine
Description: A3 Core: the a3-core program
 The A3 program /usr/bin/a3-core: the window, the Core and the audio engine as
 roles of one binary, and their systemd user units (a3-engine.service,
 a3-core.service, a3-core-window.service), none enabled by this package. It
 reads the OSC address truth from /usr/share/a3/a3-osc.json, its config from
 ~/.config/a3/engine/engine.json or /usr/share/a3-engine/engine.json, and the
 speaker layouts and IEM data from /usr/share/a3-engine/spatial. A headless
 JACK host for parity and load runs is shipped as a tool.
 .
 Installs on any machine. JACK programs find PipeWire's libjack system-wide,
 and the audio group may run realtime. The Core machine's deployment around
 it is the package a3-core.
